                                            hundred and ninety five million dollars ($195,000,000).</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="text-align: justify; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="text-align: justify; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">4.2 <B>Funding
Period.</B> The Minister will not contribute to any Eligible Supported Costs incurred by the Recipient prior to the Eligibility Date
or after the Project Completion Date. In no event will Eligible Supported Costs incurred prior to the Execution Date exceed twenty percent
(20%) of the &ldquo;Total Estimated Eligible Supported Costs&rdquo; set out in Form C2 - ESTIMATED COST BREAKDOWN BY FISCAL YEAR of Schedule
