to Premises.</B> The Recipient and its Affiliated Persons shall provide the representatives of the Minister reasonable access to premises
to inspect and assess the progress of the Project or any element thereof and supply promptly on request such data as the Minister may
reasonably require for statistical or Project evaluation purposes.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="text-align: justify; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

