The Recipient shall, at its own expense, participate in the preparation of case studies reporting on the outcomes of the Project, to
be completed by the Minister or the Minister&rsquo;s agents, in order to assist in the Minister&rsquo;s preparation of an overall evaluation
of the value and effectiveness of SRF.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="text-align: justify; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; text-transform: uppercase"><B>&nbsp;</B></FONT></P>

