in any territory, without the prior written consent of the Minister, [***]. The Recipient is permitted to grant non-exclusive licences
to the Project Intellectual Property, without prior written consent of the Minister:</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="text-align: justify; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 1in; text-indent: -0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

