                                            with Public Office Holders in respect of this Agreement are in full compliance with the registration
                                            and other requirements of the <I>Lobbying Act</I>; and</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="text-align: justify; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 1in; text-indent: -0.5in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

